This product includes the following third-party components:

1. libv2ray.aar — Xray core packaged for Android (gomobile)
   Project: https://github.com/2dust/AndroidLibXrayLite (wrapping https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core)
   License: LGPL-3.0-or-later
   Note: downloaded at build time from the official AndroidLibXrayLite releases;
   not committed to this repository.

2. hev-socks5-tunnel.aar — tun2socks (TUN → SOCKS5) for Android
   Project: https://github.com/heiher/hev-socks5-tunnel
   License: MIT
   Note: bundled at app/libs/hev-socks5-tunnel.aar — repackaged from the
   official 2.20.0 release with minSdk lowered from 29 to 26 (the library is
   pure native code with a trivial JNI bridge; no API-29 Java usage), so that
   Simorgh can support Android 8+.

3. Vazirmatn font
   Project: https://github.com/rastikerdar/vazirmatn
   License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
   Note: bundled at app/src/main/res/font/

4. GeoIP / GeoSite databases (geoip.dat, geosite.dat)
   Source: v2fly community databases, shipped as assets inside libv2ray.aar
   Projects: https://github.com/v2fly/geoip / https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community

5. eddsa (net.i2p.crypto:eddsa) — pure-Java Ed25519 signatures
   Project: https://github.com/str4d/ed25519-java
   License: MIT (with CC0 / public-domain code portions as noted upstream)
   Note: fetched from Maven Central at build time; used only to verify the
   signed remote-config channel (verification, never signing).

